    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>The General Staff: Black Powder Battle Designer Bundle</i></strong> is an integrated suite of applications for creating scenarios for use within the <i>General Staff Wargaming System</i>.  IMPORTANT: The <i>General Staff: Black Powder Wargame</i> is sold separately! The three applications in the Bundle are:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Army Editor</strong>. This Windows program makes creating three-level Order of Battle (OOB) Tables easy by employing drop-down menus and sliders. You can even copy and paste from online OOBs.<br>* <strong>The Map Editor</strong>. This Windows program is a 3D topographical terrain drawing tool. It supports mouse and drawing tablets. Images can also be imported from other applications like PhotoShop.<br>*<strong>The Scenario Editor<strong>. This Windows program merges two armies created in The Army Editor with a map created in The Map Editor to produce new battle simulations. Any two armies in the General Staff Wargaming System can be used, Set Victory conditions in the Scenario Editor. </strong></strong></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>The General Staff: Black Powder Battle Designer Bundle</i></strong> is an integrated suite of applications for creating scenarios for use within the <i>General Staff Wargaming System</i>.  IMPORTANT: The <i>General Staff: Black Powder Wargame</i> is sold separately! The three applications in the Bundle are:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Army Editor</strong>. This Windows program makes creating three-level Order of Battle (OOB) Tables easy by employing drop-down menus and sliders. You can even copy and paste from online OOBs.<br>* <strong>The Map Editor</strong>. This Windows program is a 3D topographical terrain drawing tool. It supports mouse and drawing tablets. Images can also be imported from other applications like PhotoShop.<br>*<strong>The Scenario Editor<strong>. This Windows program merges two armies created in The Army Editor with a map created in The Map Editor to produce new battle simulations. Any two armies in the General Staff Wargaming System can be used, Set Victory conditions in the Scenario Editor. </strong></strong></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The General Staff: Back Powder Battle Designer Bundle is a suite of applications for creating scenarios for use within the General Staff Wargaming System. IMPORTANT: General Staff: Black Powder wargame sold separately. Does include Army Editor, Map Editor and Scenario Editor.",
